-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:27:22.458642+00:00

The 4th dynamics class is DOMAIN ENTITIES, not 'reference entities'. Person/ExternalRef named a subcase; the class is defined by identity-bearing reference — the node names a referent rather than asserting a claim — which makes it the project's domain model, with actors and external refs as ordinary members.
