Consolidation's owner is SPLIT like the trust ladder: a deterministic read-only detector any agent may run, and a privileged commit. A consolidated node exists to be promoted past the sweep, so an agent that both abstracts and nominates its own abstraction would be writing long-term memory unsupervised.
