-> HAS_FACET [node:775f9ad3-3734-4b06-8c0f-e1e899547b3f] @ 2026-09-06T11:27:22.461830+00:00

Consolidation runs upward and strictly additively — it mints an abstraction and never edits, archives, merges, or re-tiers an instance. CONSOLIDATES is a provenance channel at policy weight 0, because an abstraction's instances are dormant on purpose and walking it at query time would undo the sweep.
