-> ABOUT [node:7e5c85c2-61c8-4061-9631-f3079d4cea25] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.415009+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.415009+00:00

created_at is the ONLY stored date column on a node. updated_at and every other timestamp is derived from the event journal, never written in place (MT3-30). A future reader looking for a modified-at column should stop looking and read events instead — the absence is the design.
