---
[node:5f9a8003-7a7b-4802-aacc-2ece5c179171]
type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/an-edge-s-primary-key-is-the-composite
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.420638+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.420638+00:00

An edge's primary key is the composite (source_id, target_id, type) — there is no edge uuid. A duplicate typed edge between the same pair is therefore impossible by construction rather than by a check, which is why write_edge can be called repeatedly without guarding.
---
