trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.421387+00:00

The traversal CTE uses UNION, not UNION ALL. The deduplication is what makes a cyclic graph terminate — switching to UNION ALL for speed would hang the walker on the first cycle, and the graph deliberately allows cycles (CONTRADICTS pairs, mutual DEPENDS_ON).
