[node:183a1a02-3e76-4b46-b8db-86c5998ce269]
type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/effective-score-structure-x-a-retriev
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.423328+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.423328+00:00

effective_score = structure x (a*retrieval_weight + b*trust_weight + c*recency), with a=0.5, b=0.3, c=0.2, hop halflife 3.0 and recency halflife 7 days as hard-coded defaults. The structural term is a multiplicative GATE, not another addend: zero structure means not returned at all, which is why selection and ranking are one number.
---
