-> HAS_FACET [node:c7bdc219-b9f2-4f03-8bf8-0588e4468eac] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.424060+00:00

_TRAVERSE_CTE's SELECT list and the positional row parser in traverse() must be changed together. They are coupled only by column ORDER, so adding a column to one and not the other misparses every row silently instead of raising — the failure looks like corrupted data, not like a bug.
