-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.424816+00:00

The scoring coefficients are pinned by test_recall_higher_weight_scores_higher, which arithmetically depends on a=0.5/b=0.3 and retrieval_weight=3.0 at depth 1. Retuning the coefficients is therefore never a one-line change; the test encodes the intended ordering and has to be re-derived with them.
