[node:d91b92e8-903c-4e40-b2c3-58d7241c900a]
type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/the-default-fold-is-sum-and-clamp-1-0
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.427475+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:4a3b8d2c-7c88-448b-8eab-b9726b9bcc2b] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.427475+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:7be44b5d-a570-4dd8-9963-64a56554321f] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.427475+00:00

The default fold is sum-and-clamp (1.0 + sum(polarity*weight), clamped to [0,1]) behind a FoldStrategy port. It was chosen because a commutative sum is TRIVIALLY order-independent, which is the slice's literal acceptance criterion under git merge — two clones applying the same events in different orders must agree. Verified with a Hypothesis property test over arbitrary permutations, not two hand-picked orderings.
---
