-> HAS_FACET [node:7be44b5d-a570-4dd8-9963-64a56554321f] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.428206+00:00

Event polarity is Literal[-1, 1]. A future event type needing fractional or multi-valued polarity is a schema migration, not a value change — and under the CHECK constraint an out-of-range polarity is rejected at insert time rather than silently folded.
