-> HAS_FACET [node:7be44b5d-a570-4dd8-9963-64a56554321f] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.428994+00:00

compact_events() is a deliberate no-op stub and the events log is unbounded. Trust folds over a node's FULL history on every recompute, so a hot node's cost grows without limit. Fine at demo and project scale, undesigned beyond it (MT3-28).
