[node:06fd70a3-be67-4511-8d00-2f1e17666940]
type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/ppr-does-not-replace-the-score-it-repl
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.431074+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:183a1a02-3e76-4b46-b8db-86c5998ce269] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.455372+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.431074+00:00

PPR does not replace the score — it replaces hop_decay in the structural-gate SEAT of it, generalizing 'how far by edges' to 'how reachable from the seed set'. The additive quality blend is untouched. That is what let slice 8 land without changing slice 3's formula, and it is why zero PPR mass still means 'not returned'.
---
