type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/the-goal-seeds-ppr-at-weight-0-7-every
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.431802+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:15b1200f-38f9-4720-a3fa-4ae9f7de6c46] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.431802+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.431802+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:d1b8fcfb-c1ed-4a81-9b03-5bfd983f68c8] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.456011+00:00

The goal seeds PPR at weight 0.7; every supplementary seed discovered from the query shares the remaining 0.3 by similarity. Goal-first is therefore STRUCTURAL, not a convention an agent could forget — and single-seed versus multi-seed collapses into one config dial (goal_weight=1.0 reproduces traverse(goal) exactly).
---
