[node:a7ed6ebb-4925-474e-b220-f0ad16aab5e2]
type: constraint
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/the-embedder-hashes-tokens-with-sha-256
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.434140+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:3552de0d-0173-495a-b48e-7e62abcd9b46] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.434140+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.434140+00:00

The embedder hashes tokens with SHA-256, never Python's builtin hash(), which is salted per process — the same query would embed differently in two runs and retrieval would stop being a pure function. Any future feature-hashing code has the same obligation.
---
