-> ABOUT [node:15b1200f-38f9-4720-a3fa-4ae9f7de6c46] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.437329+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:71ed798c-7548-4e53-aa09-e072beeaea01] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.437329+00:00
-> ABOUT [node:dd5eb147-a6a4-4c7e-b9a4-1fe0ad475b0c] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.437329+00:00

The change anchor IS a slice node, activated as a liveness root, and the goal node type is minted only by create_change. Together they make goal-first structurally checkable rather than conventional: capture_artifact rejects a non-goal anchor, so an artifact with no goal cannot be written at all.
---
