-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.438034+00:00

write_atomic commits a node with its edges and events in one transaction. An orphan node — captured but never anchored or scoped — is therefore not a state the store can reach, rather than a state that cleanup has to find later.
