[node:487a3928-ffcb-4f0c-88e0-e3b7d0479008]
type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/facet-handling-is-exact-label-reuse-nea
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.438795+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:3552de0d-0173-495a-b48e-7e62abcd9b46] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.438795+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.438795+00:00

Facet handling is exact-label reuse, near-match warn-and-SKIP, otherwise mint. The embedding finds collision candidates and the agent keeps the equivalence call — the surface never silently merges two facets nor silently duplicates one. Contrast the entity ladder, which mints on a warning and defers to a human; the asymmetry is deliberate.
---
