[node:beb09514-82ad-483f-ad7b-a41c4f7fc49e]
type: decision
tier: short-term
path: /artifact/the-recall-bundle-returns-verbatim-block
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.439541+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:6c492fa4-82b0-48e4-b246-1ddfd4d2b5ab] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.460715+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.439541+00:00

The recall bundle returns verbatim blocks, stable ids, and coarse type/tier/disputed tags — and no scores. Scores are a debugging surface for humans (the GUI); handing them to an agent invites it to reason about the ranker instead of the knowledge. The ids double as write-back handles, which is what makes the feedback loop closable.
---
