-> ABOUT [node:dd5eb147-a6a4-4c7e-b9a4-1fe0ad475b0c] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.442291+00:00

Deactivation and sweep live in scripts/memory_lifecycle.py, not on the agent surface, because they are consequences of a merge that already happened rather than judgments. An agent that could archive its own scope could quietly forget its own mistakes.
