path: /artifact/the-goal-id-is-plumbed-as-a-memory-goal
created_at: 2026-09-06T11:52:38.443071+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> ABOUT [node:15b1200f-38f9-4720-a3fa-4ae9f7de6c46] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.443071+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:71ed798c-7548-4e53-aa09-e072beeaea01] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.443071+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:d1b8fcfb-c1ed-4a81-9b03-5bfd983f68c8] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.461947+00:00

The goal id is plumbed as a `memory_goal:` line in the change's change.md — the one piece of state the binding needs, stored where the 10x lifecycle already keeps its state. It is also the only durable link back from a folder on disk to a scope in the graph, so a change.md without it is a change whose memory cannot be found again.
---
