trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:789ed067-7cbb-4bc8-b141-bf504a148482] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.456559+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:ac7287ee-97a0-4725-9a12-1441b544f6a9] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.450701+00:00
-> DEPENDS_ON [node:e08e5065-ba2a-4c0b-8883-6f528dff948e] @ 2026-09-06T11:52:38.457224+00:00

recall_multi is two independent stages: seed discovery (query embedded, compared against facet-value bodies, expanded through HAS_FACET) and structural-plus-quality composition (PPR over the content graph, then the score blend). Any benchmark treating it as one black box misattributes regressions — swapping the embedder can only ever move stage 1, so a single blended number cannot tell you whether the swap worked.
---
