Python + uv + stdlib sqlite3, chosen over Go and Rust because the decisive workload — multi-seed PPR with embeddings — is Python-first, and the MCP Python SDK is the reference implementation for the agent surface. Porting or binding those in another language would have consumed the whole timeline before the graph core was stable. Solo developer, after-hours, local-only store.
