The bootstrap record specifies GitHub Actions running lint, type-check and tests on push. In fact .github/workflows/ contains only release.yml, which triggers on version tags and builds artifacts — it never runs pytest. The full suite runs on contributors' machines and nowhere else, so a green PR means only that whoever opened it ran the tests locally.
