astral-sh/setup-uv publishes moving major tags only up to v7 while its releases have reached v10.x, so `astral-sh/setup-uv@v10` does not resolve and the job dies in 'Set up job' before checking anything out. Pin that action to an exact version. Do not assume an action publishes a floating major just because actions/checkout does — checkout@v7 resolves, setup-uv@v10 does not.
